  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: Merged CHDSharpEncoder into CHDSharpLib. The library now includes full CHD creation/encoding capabilities (ChdEncoder) alongside the existing reader. Supports raw, CD, DVD, and laserdisc encoding with all 10 codecs, parallel compression, delta/parent CHDs, and chdman-compatible output. 100% pure C#.",
